          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weũ na ndũa syaw’o nĩsyũkĩlye wasya wasyo, mĩsyĩ ĩla andũ ma Ketali mamĩtũaa; ala matwĩe Sela maine, mokĩlye wasya mũnene kuma iĩmanĩ ĩũlũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mamũnenevye Yeova, na kũtavan’ya ndaĩa yake ithamanĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeova akaumaala ta ngũmbaũ; akakan’ya kĩwĩu kyake ta mũndũ wa kaũ: akaĩa, ĩĩ, akookĩlya wasya mũnene; akameka amaitha make maũndũ me vinya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
